OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785383017
OL,3,CBank of England set to hold interest
OL,4,Crates at 3.75%
OL,6,FThe Bank of England is expected to
OL,7,Fhold interest rates again next week
OL,8,Fdespite fresh uncertainty in the
OL,9,FMiddle East.
OL,11,FEconomists have said they still expect
OL,12,Fa majority of the Bank's rate-setting
OL,13,Fcommittee to opt to keep the base
OL,14,Finterest rate at 3.75% despite attacks
OL,15,Fin the region and US threats
OL,16,Freigniting some concerns over
OL,17,Finflation.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
