OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785383017
OL,3,CBank of England set to hold interest
OL,4,Crates at 3.75%
OL,6,FA number of economists, including
OL,7,Fexperts at Oxford Economics and
OL,8,FNomura, have predicted another seven-
OL,9,Fto-two vote in favour of holding the
OL,10,Fcurrent rate.
OL,12,FThe latest meeting of the Monetary
OL,13,FPolicy Committee (MPC) on Thursday
OL,14,FJuly 30, which will also see it unveil
OL,15,Ffresh economic forecasts, comes amid a
OL,16,Fbackdrop of easing inflation in recent
OL,17,Fmonths.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
