OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30208
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785383017
OL,3,CBank of England set to hold interest
OL,4,Crates at 3.75%
OL,6,FThe intensifying conflict in the
OL,7,FMiddle East is also likely to impact
OL,8,Fthe Bank's growth outlook, after GDP
OL,9,Frebounded in May, although only rising
OL,10,Fby 0.1% for the month.
OL,12,FRate-setters could be cautious to hike
OL,13,Finterest rates amid a backdrop of
OL,14,Fstagnant growth in the UK economy.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/8
